# git is case-sensitive even on a case-insensitive filesystem: the pattern
# above never matched the repo-root build output of `go build`, which is
# capitalized to match the module/binary name (ForgeGrid / ForgeGrid.exe on
# Windows), so those kept slipping past this ignore and getting committed.
